  "notes": "Roman War Council shows '2* Command Cards' (cards=2, ramps to 4 per cardsNote). Carthaginian moves first. Uncaptioned Carthaginian leaders at 2,2 (with MC) and 3,6 (with AX) have name '' (only Hannibal and Flaminius are captioned). DISCREPANCY: official roster lists 2 Roman leaders but the map image shows only one (Flaminius at 7,4); image trusted, so Roman LDR=1. A forum post on the scenario page says the setup image is in error and a second Roman leader should be attached to the Roman heavy infantry in the Roman right section - that would be the HI at 8,9 (the only HI right of the section line); not added because it is not on the image. Terrain: 'steep' = the four captioned 'Steep' hill hexes (impassable per special rules); 'lake' = Lake Trasimenus along the bottom edge (8,2-8,6, impassable). Hills at 3,5 and 4,1 are partly hidden under unit blocks (hill texture visible around the blocks in the un-gridded map)."
